ds in current .beads/\nbd list --dir /path/to/rig             # List beads in a specific rig\nbd ready                               # List beads available for claiming\nbd ready --label role:worker           # Filter by label\nbd show <id>                           # Show bead details\n```\n\n## Claiming and updating\n\n```\nbd update <id> --claim                 # Claim a bead (sets assignee + in_progress)\nbd update <id> --status in_progress    # Update status\nbd update <id> --label <key>=<value>   # Add/update labels\nbd update <id> --note \"progress...\"    # Add a note\n```\n\n## Closing work\n\n```\nbd close <id>                          # Close a completed bead\nbd close <id> --reason \"done\"          # Close with reason\n```\n\n## Hooks\n\n```\ngc hook show <agent>                   # Show what's on an agent's hook\ngc agent claim <agent> <id>            # Put a bead on an agent's hook\n```\n  </instructions>\n\n  <available_resources>\n    Showing up to 200 items (files + folders).\n\n/usr/local/google/home/jkramberger/agentic-ipa/ipa-city/.gemini/skills/core.gc-work/\n└───SKILL.md\n  </available_resources>\n</activated_skill>"}}}],"resultDisplay":"Skill **gc-work** activated. Resources loaded from `/usr/local/google/home/jkramberger/agentic-ipa/ipa-city/.gemini/skills/core.gc-work`:\n\nShowing up to 200 items (files + folders).\n\n/usr/local/google/home/jkramberger/agentic-ipa/ipa-city/.gemini/skills/core.gc-work/\n└───SKILL.md","contentLength":2365},"durationMs":47,"outcome":"proceed_once","schedulerId":"root","approvalMode":"yolo"},{"request":{"callId":"yq15q6g9","name":"activate_skill","args":{"name":"gc-mail"},"isClientInitiated":false,"prompt_id":"a0b99eb0-49a6-4799-9de2-e221e01da386","traceId":"BB_0afHGC_2cz7IPhaGW2QU","schedulerId":"root"},"tool":{"name":"activate_skill","displayName":"Activate Skill","description":"Activates a specialized agent skill by name (Available: 'skill-creator', 'k8s-deploy', 'gc-work', 'gc-rigs', 'gc-mail', 'gc-dispatch